.git/

# The Flask backend runs on its own host (see render.yaml); Vercel only builds
# the Next.js app. Excluding the root api/ stops Vercel from producing a Python
# function that can never serve /api/* — those paths belong to Next's app/api
# routes.
#
# The leading slash is required. Unanchored, "api/" matches a directory named
# api at any depth, which also excludes app/api/ and 404s every Next API route.
/api/

